  "body": "Before, it waited until there was a reason to call them, then errored the stream when it couldn't. But this can easily be caught much earlier in the constructor instead the same way strategies are already validated.\n\nIt looks like it would've never even been noticeable if `abort` or `cancel` were set to a non-function.\n",
